          %p The multiplication of the monad must be interpreted as the composition of smooth functions.
          %p
          .num_defn
            %h6 Definition
            %p
              A codifferential category is a CMon-enriched
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+monoidal+category"} symmetric monoidal category
              together with an algebra modality and a deriving transformation ie. a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+transformation"} natural transformation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi d
                    %mo :
                    %mi S
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi A
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo →
                    %mi S
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi A
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ⊗
                    %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d:S(A) \rightarrow S(A) \otimes A
              such that the following diagrams commute:
