                %em Differential categories revisited,
                Appl. Categ. Struct. 28, 171-235 (2020). (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.04804"}> arXiv:1806.04804
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s10485-019-09572-y"} doi:10.1007/s10485-019-09572-y
          %p
